Laisser poser 10 minutes. Rincer abondamment.',18800,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/products/psoriane-shampooing_e84b3007-510e-4b51-9304-ec0264bb4910.png?v=1630347464',10,1,'6728991473839','39910188056751','https://beautymarket.ma/products/noreva-psoriane-shampoing-intensif-125ml',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/products/psoriane-shampooing_e84b3007-510e-4b51-9304-ec0264bb4910.png?v=1630347464"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO products(name,brand,category,description,price,image,stock,active,source_product_id,source_variant_id,source_url,source_available,images_json,sku) VALUES ('NOREVA ZENIAC LP FORT SOIN REGULATEUR INTENSIF 30 ml','Noreva','Visage','Soin intensif concentré en Alpha-Hydroxy-Acides (AHA) et acide salicylique,

