PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRA-DI-T-BUTYL HYDROXYHYDROCINNAMATE, CERAMIDE EOP,

TRIISOPROPANOLAMINE, CI 77492 (IRON OXIDES), DIMETHICONE, MAGNESIUM SULFATE,

