PENTAERYTHRITYL DISTEARATE, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, OCTYLDODECANOL,

C20-22 ALKYL PHOSPHATE, HYDROGENATED STARCH HYDROLYSATE, C20-22 ALCOHOLS,

MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM SILICATE, NELUMBIUM SPECIOSUM FLOWER EXTRACT (NELUMBO NUCIFERA FLOWER WATER),

SESAMUM INDICUM (SESAME) SEED EXTRACT, SERENOA SERRULATA FRUIT EXTRACT,

